{"title":"Dune Alpha","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Desert Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: packDamagePerAlly: .15</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>305</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>108</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Camp\">Thak Scout Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Camp\">Thak Scout Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>305</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>108</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 215 total, 103–112 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×103–112</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link quest\" data-i